This license covers the source code in this repository only.

The MS3SEG dataset is not redistributed here. It is published separately by
Bashiri Bawil et al. under CC BY 4.0 at doi:10.6084/m9.figshare.30393475 and is
subject to that license and to the ethics approval recorded in the accompanying
data descriptor (Scientific Data 13:867, 2026).

Pretrained Mix Transformer encoder weights are downloaded at run time from the
Hugging Face Hub (nvidia/segformer-*, nvidia/mit-*) and remain subject to NVIDIA's
license terms for those checkpoints.
